# Accounts 창: 빈 목록에서 추가 양식이 열리고, 추가(Add & Open) → 이름 바꾸기 → 제거가 목록 파일(JS 형식)에 반영된다.
# 첫 터미널은 PowerShell이라 계정 터미널이 Windows 폴더에서 열린다. 실행기는 가짜 claude·codex 명령을 PATH 앞에 둔다.
waittabs 1 @30000
act envmenu
waitstate menu: environments @5000
act menuitem PowerShell
waittabs 2 @30000
waitstate cwd=C: @30000
act accounts
waitoverlay accounts @5000
waitstate acct dialog form=true @5000
shot accounts-empty
act acct name Main
shot accounts-form
act acct add
waittabs 3 @30000
waitoverlay none @5000
waitstate account=Claude · Main @30000
state added-claude
act accounts
waitoverlay accounts @5000
act acct showform
act acct provider codex
act acct name Work
act acct add
waittabs 4 @30000
waitoverlay none @5000
waitstate account=Codex · Work @30000
act accounts
waitoverlay accounts @5000
waitstate acct profile id= @5000
shot accounts-list
act acct rename 1 Renamed
waitstate label=Renamed @5000
shot accounts-renamed
act acct remove 2
wait 500
state accounts-after-remove
act acct close
waitoverlay none @5000
quit
